english:
I've put you down for *{service}* on *{when}* (West Africa Time).

Reference: #{ref}

If that time doesn't work, just say *"reschedule"* and I'll move it.

current_ha:
Na yi maka rajistar *{service}* ranar *{when}* (lokacin Najeriya).

Lambar tunani: #{ref}

Idan lokacin bai dace ba, ka ce *"reschedule"* zan canza shi.

english:
✅ Your booking for *{service}* has been successfully cancelled.

Reference: #{ref}

If you paid and would like a refund, please say *"I need a refund"* and I'll raise a request for you.

current_ha:
✅ An soke rajistarka ta *{service}*.

Lambar tunani: #{ref}

Idan ka biya kuma kana son a mayar da kudi, ka ce *"I need a refund"* zan shirya maka.

english:
Here is what I have — please check it carefully before I register you:

• Name: {name}
• Age / DOB: {age}
• Address: {address}
• LGA: {lga}
• Plan: {plan}{free}
• Primary facility: {facility}
• NIN: {nin}

Is all of that correct? Reply *yes* to register, or tell me what to change.

current_ha:
Ga abin da na samu — ka duba shi da kyau kafin in yi maka rijista:

• Suna: {name}
• Shekaru / Ranar haihuwa: {age}
• Adireshi: {address}
• Karamar Hukuma: {lga}
• Shiri: {plan}{free}
• Babbar cibiya: {facility}
• NIN: {nin}

Duk daidai ne? Ka amsa *yes* in yi rijista, ko ka gaya mini abin da zan canza.

english:
You have more than one coming up. Which would you like to {verb}?

{list}

Reply with the number.

current_ha:
Kana da fiye da daya mai zuwa. Wanne kake son {verb}?

{list}

Ka amsa da lamba.

english:
{heading}Here is what is free:

{list}

Reply with the number that suits you. If none of these work, say *"speak to an agent"* and a colleague will find something else.

current_ha:
{heading}Ga lokutan da suke a bude:

{list}

Ka amsa da lambar da ta dace da kai. Idan babu wanda ya dace, ka ce *"speak to an agent"* abokin aiki zai nemo wani.

english:
I can only move it to one of these, so that I do not put you down for a time that is already taken:

{list}

Reply with the number, or say *"speak to an agent"* for anything else.

current_ha:
Zan iya canza shi zuwa daya daga cikin wadannan kawai, don kada in sa ka a lokacin da aka riga aka dauka:

{list}

Ka amsa da lamba, ko ka ce *"speak to an agent"*.

english:
Happy to book you in for a {service}. Here is what is free:

{list}

Reply with the number that suits you. If none of these work, say *"speak to an agent"* and a colleague will find something else.

current_ha:
Zan iya yi maka rijistar {service}. Ga lokutan da suke a bude:

{list}

Ka amsa da lambar da ta dace da kai. Idan babu wanda ya dace, ka ce *"speak to an agent"*.

english:
I can only book one of these, so that I do not put you down for a time that is already taken:

{list}

Reply with the number, or say *"speak to an agent"* for anything else.

current_ha:
Zan iya yin rijista a daya daga cikin wadannan kawai, don kada in sa ka a lokacin da aka riga aka dauka:

{list}

Ka amsa da lamba, ko ka ce *"speak to an agent"*.

