english:
Just to confirm before I change anything:

• {label}
• From: {from}
• To: {to}

Reply *yes* to move it, or tell me what to change.

current_ha:
Bari in tabbatar kafin in canza komai:

• {label}
• Daga: {from}
• Zuwa: {to}

Ka amsa *yes* in canza shi, ko ka gaya mini abin da zan canza.

english:
Just to be sure, because this cannot be undone:

• {label}
• {when}

Reply *yes* to cancel it, or *no* to leave it as it is.

current_ha:
Bari in tabbata, saboda ba za a iya mayar da shi ba:

• {label}
• {when}

Ka amsa *yes* in soke shi, ko *no* ya kasance kamar yadda yake.
